B.Ts=new A.ao(B.TY,["Annuler","Confirmer","Enregistrer","Supprimer","Modifier","Appliquer","Oui","Non","Rechercher un nageur","Personne de disponible","estim\xe9","(estim\xe9)","r\xe9el","Temps","Nage","Nom","Type","en attente des chronos","Temps illisible (ex. 35,42 ou 1:05,32)","Tournoi relais du club","Groupe {n}","\xc9quipe {n}","{n} nageurs ({f} F / {g} G)","{n} groupes","Composez des relais \xe9quilibr\xe9s en quelques secondes.","Langue","Langue de l'appareil","Vous \xeates\u2026","Entra\xeeneur","G\xe9rez vos nageurs, les r\xe8gles du tournoi, les groupes et les relais.","Nageur","Tenez votre fiche et vos temps \xe0 jour, et suivez votre progression.","Vous pourrez changer de profil \xe0 tout moment dans les r\xe9glages.","Nageurs","R\xe8gles","\xc9preuves","Propositions","Tournoi","Archives","R\xe9glages","Ajouter un nageur","Modifier le nageur","Aucun nageur pour l'instant. Ajoutez vos nageurs, ou chargez des exemples pour tester.","Charger 16 nageurs d'exemple","Marquer tout le monde pr\xe9sent","Supprimer tous les nageurs","Tous les nageurs seront supprim\xe9s. L'historique des temps est conserv\xe9.","Supprimer {nom} ?","{n} nageurs \xb7 {p} pr\xe9sents ({f} F / {g} G). Touchez un nageur pour le modifier, cochez la case pour le marquer pr\xe9sent.","Cat\xe9gorie","Niveau / bonnet","Groupe de niveau, couleur de bonnet ou \xe9quipe (ex. \xab Bonnet rouge \xbb, \xab Poisson vert \xbb). Cr\xe9ez la liste du club dans R\xe9glages \u203a Niveaux et cat\xe9gories.","Pr\xe9sent au tournoi","F","G","?","Fille","Gar\xe7on","Non pr\xe9cis\xe9","Temps sur {d} m","En secondes (35,42) ou en minutes (1:05,32). X = ne nage pas cette nage. Vide = estim\xe9 \xe0 partir des autres nages.","Score","sp\xe9cialit\xe9","Nom en double","Sexe non pr\xe9cis\xe9","Aucun temps","Niveau / bonnet manquant","Dos","Brasse","Papillon","Nage libre","Dos","Br.","Pap.","NL","4 nages","Nage libre","Dos","Brasse","Papillon","R\xe8gle g\xe9n\xe9rale","Libre","Parit\xe9 filles / gar\xe7ons","Au moins 1 fille et 1 gar\xe7on","Filles uniquement","Gar\xe7ons uniquement","Mod\xe8les :","F\xeate du club","Groupes \xe9quilibr\xe9s, filles et gar\xe7ons r\xe9partis, tout le monde nage, 2 relais maximum par nageur.","Interclubs","Meilleure \xe9quipe d'abord (\xe9quipe 1, puis 2\u2026), meilleurs temps, recherche approfondie.","Animation jeunes","Groupes \xe9quilibr\xe9s, au moins une fille et un gar\xe7on par relais, tout le monde nage, estimation prudente des temps manquants.","\xc9quipes par bonnet / niveau","Un groupe par niveau ou couleur de bonnet (fiche du nageur ou groupe d'entra\xeenement), tout le monde nage.","Les r\xe9ponses actuelles seront remplac\xe9es par celles de ce mod\xe8le.","Mod\xe8le \xab {nom} \xbb appliqu\xe9.","Tournoi","Groupes","Relais","Temps","Calcul","Nom du tournoi","Sert pour l'archivage et l'historique des temps.","Date du tournoi","Quel est l'objectif ?","\xc9quilibrer : groupes de niveau proche (f\xeate du club, tournoi interne). Meilleure \xe9quipe d'abord : l'\xe9quipe 1 re\xe7oit les meilleurs, puis l'\xe9quipe 2\u2026 (comp\xe9tition officielle).","\xc9quilibrer les groupes","Meilleure \xe9quipe d'abord","Combien de groupes ? (0 = automatique)","Un groupe = une \xe9quipe qui nage chaque relais une fois. Automatique : nombre de nageurs pr\xe9sents \xf7 nombre de nageurs du plus grand relais.","Les niveaux / bonnets comptent-ils pour former les groupes ?","Utile si le club r\xe9partit ses nageurs par niveau ou couleur de bonnet (bonnets rouges / blancs, Poisson vert, Pass'comp\xe9tition\u2026).","Ne pas en tenir compte","Un groupe par niveau / bonnet (ex. bonnets rouges contre bonnets blancs)","M\xe9langer : chaque niveau r\xe9parti \xe9quitablement entre les groupes","\xc9quilibrer filles et gar\xe7ons entre les groupes ?","R\xe9partit les filles et les gar\xe7ons \xe0 parts \xe9gales dans chaque groupe.","\xc9quilibrer les cat\xe9gories d'\xe2ge entre les groupes ?","R\xe9partit chaque cat\xe9gorie \xe0 parts \xe9gales dans chaque groupe.","Composition par d\xe9faut des relais","S'applique aux \xe9preuves r\xe9gl\xe9es sur \xab R\xe8gle g\xe9n\xe9rale \xbb. R\xe8gle officielle d'un relais mixte : 2 filles et 2 gar\xe7ons.","Nombre maximum de relais par nageur (0 = illimit\xe9)","Un nageur peut nager plusieurs relais de son groupe, mais un seul parcours par relais.","Tout le monde doit-il nager au moins un relais ?","Si oui, un nageur qui fait d\xe9j\xe0 plusieurs relais laisse sa place \xe0 celui qui n'en a aucun, en perdant le moins de temps possible.","Distance des temps saisis","Distance sur laquelle les temps des nageurs sont saisis. Pour un relais d'une autre distance (onglet \xc9preuves), le temps est converti proportionnellement : approximatif au-del\xe0 de 2 fois cette distance (la fatigue n'est pas prise en compte). Pour des relais de 200 m, saisissez plut\xf4t des temps sur 100 ou 200 m.","Quels temps utiliser ?","Avec l'historique, les temps r\xe9alis\xe9s lors des tournois archiv\xe9s comptent aussi.","Temps saisis uniquement","Temps saisis + historique des tournois","Quel temps retenir quand il y a un historique ?","Meilleur : le plus rapide. Dernier : le temps saisi, sinon le plus r\xe9cent. Moyenne : les 3 tournois les plus r\xe9cents.","Meilleur temps","Dernier temps","Moyenne des 3 derniers","Si un nageur n'a pas de temps dans une nage","L'estimation utilise ses autres nages. Les temps estim\xe9s s'affichent en italique.","Estimer \xe0 partir de ses autres nages","Estimer avec marge de prudence (+5 %)","Ne pas l'aligner dans cette nage","Profondeur de recherche","Approfondie teste plus de combinaisons de groupes (un peu plus long).","Rapide","Normale","Approfondie","Coefficients d'estimation","Temps de chaque nage par rapport \xe0 la nage libre (1,13 = 13 % plus lent). Hypoth\xe8se de d\xe9part \xe0 ajuster avec les vrais temps du club.","Usages repris des r\xe8glements FFN (relais 4 nages, relais mixtes) et des comp\xe9titions jeunes par \xe9quipes. Chaque club adapte ces r\xe8gles.","Activez les relais du tournoi. Touchez une \xe9preuve pour la modifier.","Ajouter une \xe9preuve","Modifier l'\xe9preuve","R\xe9tablir les \xe9preuves par d\xe9faut","La liste des \xe9preuves sera remplac\xe9e par les 9 \xe9preuves propos\xe9es par d\xe9faut.","Nom de l'\xe9preuve","Nombre de nageurs","Distance par nageur","Composition","Poids","Importance dans l'\xe9quilibrage (2 = compte double).","Exclusivit\xe9","M\xeame lettre sur deux relais = nageurs tous diff\xe9rents.","Relais 4 nages : dos, brasse, papillon, puis nage libre ; chaque nageur couvre un quart de la distance.","Le nom de l'\xe9preuve est vide","Entre 1 et 12 nageurs","Un relais 4 nages se fait \xe0 4 nageurs","Distance manquante","Nouvelle proposition","Calcul en cours\u2026","Aucune proposition. Touchez \xab Nouvelle proposition \xbb pour calculer les groupes et l'ordre des nageurs.","Chaque nouvelle proposition s'ajoute \xe0 la liste. Validez celle qui vous convient : elle passe dans l'onglet Tournoi.","Effacer les propositions","Toutes les propositions seront effac\xe9es. Le tournoi valid\xe9 est conserv\xe9.","Tout effacer","Proposition","valid\xe9e","\xc9cart entre groupes","Valider","Proposition n\xb0 {n} valid\xe9e.","Des temps r\xe9els sont d\xe9j\xe0 saisis dans le tournoi en cours. Les remplacer par cette proposition ?","Ne nage aucun relais","Sans relais malgr\xe9 la r\xe8gle","Relais incomplet : composition ou nombre maximum de relais trop stricts ?","Aucun nageur pr\xe9sent.","Aucune \xe9preuve active valide.","La r\xe8gle \xab un groupe par niveau / bonnet \xbb est choisie, mais aucun nageur pr\xe9sent n'a de niveau.","\xc9preuve \xab {nom} \xbb ignor\xe9e : {raison}.","\xab {nom} \xbb demande {n} nageurs diff\xe9rents, mais un groupe n'en a que {k}.","{besoin} parcours \xe0 nager par groupe, mais avec {k} nageurs et {max} relais maximum chacun, un groupe ne peut en couvrir que {cap}.","R\xe8gle \xab tout le monde nage \xbb impossible : {besoin} parcours pour des groupes jusqu'\xe0 {k} nageurs.","Pas trouv\xe9 de groupes diff\xe9rents des propositions pr\xe9c\xe9dentes : celle-ci reprend des groupes d\xe9j\xe0 propos\xe9s.","Aucun tournoi en cours. Validez une proposition pour commencer.","Voir les propositions","Saisissez le temps de chaque nageur. Touchez un nom pour le remplacer. Totaux et classements se calculent d\xe8s que tous les parcours d'un relais sont chronom\xe9tr\xe9s.","Classements","Classement g\xe9n\xe9ral","Remplacer par\u2026","autre groupe","2 fois dans ce relais","trop de relais","dans 2 groupes","Nouveau tournoi","Le tournoi en cours est archiv\xe9 (Archives et historique des temps), puis on repart de z\xe9ro.","Temps \xe0 ressaisir","Le tournoi est archiv\xe9, les propositions sont effac\xe9es et les temps des nageurs sont vid\xe9s (noms, sexes et couleurs conserv\xe9s).","\xc0 partir des temps du tournoi","Le tournoi est archiv\xe9 et chaque temps r\xe9el remplace le temps du nageur (converti \xe0 la distance de r\xe9f\xe9rence ; le meilleur s'il a nag\xe9 plusieurs fois la m\xeame nage). Une nouvelle proposition est calcul\xe9e.","Nom du prochain tournoi (facultatif)","Tournoi archiv\xe9 : {n} temps ajout\xe9s \xe0 l'historique.","Aucun tournoi archiv\xe9 pour l'instant.","Tournois pass\xe9s. L'historique contient {n} temps, utilis\xe9s selon la r\xe8gle \xab Quels temps utiliser ? \xbb.","Supprimer ce tournoi des archives ? Les temps d\xe9j\xe0 dans l'historique sont conserv\xe9s.","Profil","Apparence","Auto","Clair","Sombre","Club","Nom du club","Affich\xe9 en haut de l'\xe9cran \xe0 la place du nom de l'appli.","Importer un logo","Retirer le logo","Image trop lourde (1 Mo maximum).","Utiliser les couleurs du club","Sinon : th\xe8me \xab piscine \xbb bleu et turquoise.","Couleur principale","Couleur secondaire","Donn\xe9es","Tout est enregistr\xe9 sur cet appareil, sans compte.","Nageurs, propositions, tournoi, archives et historique seront effac\xe9s. Les r\xe9glages d'apparence sont conserv\xe9s. Une copie de s\xe9curit\xe9 est faite juste avant : elle reste dans Sauvegardes automatiques.","\xc0 propos","Prochaines \xe9tapes : chronom\xe8tre bord de bassin, s\xe9ances d'entra\xeenement, groupes en ligne.","Ma fiche","Mes temps","Compl\xe9tez votre fiche","Mes temps de r\xe9f\xe9rence ({d} m)","Partager ma fiche avec mon entra\xeeneur","Bient\xf4t : par QR code ou fichier, sans compte.","Ajouter un temps","Ajoutez vos temps de comp\xe9tition pour suivre votre progression.","Comp\xe9tition (facultatif)","Ligne 4","Entra\xeenement, suivi des nageurs et relais \xe9quilibr\xe9s.","Groupes","Organisateur de tournoi","Version \xab tournoi \xbb seulement : nageurs, r\xe8gles, \xe9preuves, propositions de relais et r\xe9sultats.","Tous","Sans groupe","Groupe","Groupe d'entra\xeenement","Fermer","Renommer","Partager","Imprimer / PDF","Cr\xe9er un groupe","Nom du groupe","ex. Benjamins mardi","Aucun groupe pour l'instant. Cr\xe9ez un groupe d'entra\xeenement pour inviter vos nageurs par QR code.","{n} nageur(s)","Supprimer le groupe \xab {nom} \xbb ? Les nageurs sont conserv\xe9s, sans groupe.","\xc9changer avec vos nageurs","1. Montrez le QR d'invitation d'un groupe : le nageur le scanne avec l'appli (profil Nageur).\n2. Le nageur remplit sa fiche et ses temps, puis affiche son QR \xab Partager ma fiche \xbb.\n3. Scannez-le ici : sa fiche est ajout\xe9e ou mise \xe0 jour. Sans compte, sans internet.","Importer une fiche nageur","QR d'invitation","Faites scanner ce code par vos nageurs (appli Ligne 4, profil Nageur, \xab Rejoindre un groupe \xbb).","Pas de cam\xe9ra ? Copiez le code ou enregistrez-le en fichier, puis envoyez-le par message ou par mail.","Copier le code","Code copi\xe9.","Enregistrer en fichier","Lire un code Ligne 4","Scanner un QR code","Ou collez le code re\xe7u","Ou ouvrez un fichier .ligne4","Ce n'est pas un code Ligne 4 valide.","Ce code n'est pas une fiche nageur.","Ce code n'est pas une invitation de groupe.","{nom} ajout\xe9(e) : {n} temps import\xe9s.","Fiche de {nom} mise \xe0 jour : {n} nouveaux temps.","Aucun groupe rejoint","Rejoindre un groupe","Changer de groupe","Quitter le groupe","Scannez le QR d'invitation de votre entra\xeeneur pour rattacher votre fiche \xe0 son groupe.","Vous rejoignez \xab {groupe} \xbb ({club}). Utiliser aussi les couleurs du club dans l'appli ?","Groupe \xab {groupe} \xbb rejoint.","QR code, code \xe0 copier ou fichier : votre entra\xeeneur l'importe en un geste.","Montrez ce code \xe0 votre entra\xeeneur : il le scanne dans \xab Groupes \xbb > \xab Importer une fiche nageur \xbb.","Compl\xe9tez d'abord votre nom dans \xab Modifier \xbb.","Importer depuis Excel","Exporter en Excel","Aucune feuille avec une colonne \xab Nom \xbb trouv\xe9e dans ce fichier.","{a} nageur(s) ajout\xe9(s), {m} mis \xe0 jour.","Disposition compatible avec le classeur Excel Relais natation (colonnes A \xe0 I). Temps en secondes, X = nage interdite.","~ = temps estim\xe9 \xe0 partir des autres nages du nageur.","G\xe9n\xe9ral","Langue et profil","Apparence et club","Th\xe8me, nom du club, logo, couleurs","Donn\xe9es et sauvegarde","Sauvegarder, restaurer, effacer","\xc0 propos et contact","Cr\xe9ateur, signaler un bug, sugg\xe9rer une id\xe9e","Th\xe8me","Aper\xe7u","Couleurs par d\xe9faut","Sauvegarde","Un seul fichier .ligne4 contient tout (nageurs, groupes, r\xe8gles, tournois, archives, r\xe9glages), avec une empreinte de contr\xf4le. Gardez-le en lieu s\xfbr ou transf\xe9rez-le vers un autre appareil.","Sauvegarder dans un fichier","Sauvegarde enregistr\xe9e.","Restaurer une sauvegarde","Toutes les donn\xe9es actuelles seront remplac\xe9es par celles de la sauvegarde.","Sauvegarde restaur\xe9e.","Ce fichier n'est pas une sauvegarde Ligne 4 valide.","Synchronisation en ligne","Sur Android, la sauvegarde syst\xe8me de Google peut aussi garder les donn\xe9es de l'appli avec votre compte. Bient\xf4t : groupes en direct entre entra\xeeneur et nageurs.","Autres","Cr\xe9\xe9 par {auteur}, avec l'assistance de Claude (Anthropic).","Signaler un bug","Sugg\xe9rer une id\xe9e","Adresse copi\xe9e.","Aucune messagerie trouv\xe9e : l'adresse {mail} a \xe9t\xe9 copi\xe9e, collez-la dans votre mail.","Bug","Suggestion","D\xe9crivez le probl\xe8me : ce que vous faisiez, ce qui s'est pass\xe9, ce que vous attendiez.","D\xe9crivez votre id\xe9e et \xe0 quoi elle vous servirait.","Confidentialit\xe9 : vos donn\xe9es restent sur cet appareil. Rien n'est envoy\xe9 sans action de votre part (sauvegarde, partage, QR code). La recherche de mises \xe0 jour lit seulement un fichier public, sans rien envoyer de vos donn\xe9es.","Accueil","Pour d\xe9marrer","Exemples","Nageurs ({n})","Ajoutez vos nageurs un par un, depuis un fichier Excel, depuis la fiche QR d'un nageur, ou chargez des exemples pour tester.","Groupes d'entra\xeenement ({n})","Cr\xe9ez un groupe, cochez ses nageurs, puis montrez son QR d'invitation \xe0 vos nageurs.","Voir les groupes","R\xe8gles du tournoi","Objectif, nombre de groupes, mixit\xe9, relais par nageur\u2026 ou un mod\xe8le en un clic.","\xc9preuves ({n} actives)","Choisissez les relais nag\xe9s lors du tournoi.","Calculer les relais","{p} nageur(s) pr\xe9sent(s). Chaque calcul ajoute une proposition ; validez celle qui vous convient.","Tournoi","Saisissez les temps r\xe9els, imprimez ou partagez les r\xe9sultats.","Inviter vos nageurs en 4 \xe9tapes","Cr\xe9er un groupe","Par exemple \xab Benjamins mardi \xbb.","Choisir ses nageurs","Cochez les nageurs d\xe9j\xe0 dans l'appli (ajout\xe9s \xe0 la main, par Excel ou en exemple).","Montrer le QR d'invitation","Les nageurs le scannent avec l'appli, profil Nageur.","Importer leurs fiches","Chaque nageur affiche le QR de sa fiche : scannez-le pour r\xe9cup\xe9rer ses temps.","Cr\xe9er mon premier groupe","Aucun nageur dans ce groupe pour l'instant.","Choisir les nageurs","Ajoutez d'abord des nageurs (onglet Nageurs ou Accueil).","Tout cocher","Tout d\xe9cocher","{n} s\xe9lectionn\xe9(s)","Actuellement dans \xab {groupe} \xbb","Couleurs rapides","Code couleur : tapez-le dans le champ # (ex. 0077B6), ou choisissez sur la roue.","Toute distance : 25, 50, 100, 200\u2026 Le temps est calcul\xe9 \xe0 partir de la distance des temps saisis (R\xe8gles).","Niveaux et cat\xe9gories","Bonnets, groupes de niveau, cat\xe9gories d'\xe2ge","Dans les clubs, les nageurs sont souvent rep\xe9r\xe9s par un niveau : couleur de bonnet par groupe, groupes \xab Poisson vert \xbb, \xab Dauphins \xbb, niveaux de couleur, Pass de l'\xc9cole de Natation Fran\xe7aise\u2026 Cr\xe9ez ici la liste de votre club ; chaque nageur (ou chaque groupe d'entra\xeenement) re\xe7oit ensuite un niveau.","Affichage","Masqu\xe9","Pastille","Pastille + nom","S'applique \xe0 la liste des nageurs, aux propositions, au tournoi et aux PDF. Masqu\xe9 n'efface rien : les r\xe8gles de relais peuvent toujours s'en servir.","Niveaux du club","Aucun niveau pour l'instant. Ajoutez-en un, ou partez d'un mod\xe8le.","{n} nageur(s)","Ajouter un niveau","Modifier le niveau","Mod\xe8les","Couleurs de bonnet","Groupes animaux (Crabes \u2192 Requins)","Niveaux de couleur (rose \u2192 mauve)","Parcours ENF (Sauv'nage \u2192 Pass 4 Nages)","Ajouter ces niveaux \xe0 votre liste, ou remplacer la liste actuelle ? (Les nageurs gardent leur niveau.)","Ajouter","Remplacer","Ajouter les niveaux saisis \xe0 la main ({n}) : {liste}","\xab {nom} \xbb est utilis\xe9 par {n} nageur(s) ou groupe(s). Le retirer aussi de leurs fiches ?","Garder dans les fiches","Retirer partout","Nom du niveau","ex. Bonnet rouge, Poisson vert","Donnez un nom au niveau.","Ce nom existe d\xe9j\xe0.","Couleur","Symbole (facultatif)","Un \xe9moji affich\xe9 dans la pastille. Tapez-le ou choisissez ci-dessous.","Aucun","Aucun","(hors liste)","Laissez \xab Aucun \xbb pour reprendre le niveau du groupe d'entra\xeenement.","Reprend le niveau du groupe \xab {groupe} \xbb : {niveau}.","Niveau / bonnet du groupe","Donn\xe9 aux nageurs du groupe qui n'ont pas encore de niveau.","Niveau donn\xe9 \xe0 {n} nageur(s).","Donner le niveau du groupe \xe0 tous ses membres","Modifier le groupe","Tous niveaux","Sans niveau","Ann\xe9e de naissance","Facultatif : permet de calculer la cat\xe9gorie.","Cat\xe9gorie calcul\xe9e : {c}","Cat\xe9gorie FFN : {c} (activez le calcul dans R\xe9glages \u203a Niveaux et cat\xe9gories)","Le calcul automatique est actif : l'ann\xe9e de naissance prime sur ce champ.","Cat\xe9gories d'\xe2ge","Calcul\xe9es depuis l'ann\xe9e de naissance, pour l'ann\xe9e du tournoi ({annee}). Depuis 2026, la FFN (natation course) n'utilise plus Avenirs, Benjamins, Juniors\u2026 mais l'\xe2ge atteint dans l'ann\xe9e : U12, U13\u2026 U18.","Saisie \xe0 la main","La cat\xe9gorie est celle tap\xe9e dans la fiche de chaque nageur.","\xc2ge FFN (U12, U13\u2026 U18, Seniors)","R\xe8gle FFN depuis 2026 : \xe2ge atteint dans l'ann\xe9e.","Anciennes cat\xe9gories","Avenirs, Jeunes, Juniors, Seniors (filles un an plus t\xf4t que les gar\xe7ons), encore utilis\xe9es par certains clubs.","\xc9crire les cat\xe9gories dans les fiches","La cat\xe9gorie calcul\xe9e remplacera celle tap\xe9e dans la fiche de chaque nageur dont l'ann\xe9e est connue.","{n} fiche(s) mise(s) \xe0 jour.","Bonnet rouge","Bonnet blanc","Bonnet bleu","Bonnet jaune","Bonnet vert","Bonnet noir","Crabes","Hippocampes","Poisson vert","Poisson bleu","Dauphins","Requins","Niveau rose","Niveau jaune","Niveau vert","Niveau bleu","Niveau mauve","Sauv'nage","Pass'sports de l'eau","Pass'comp\xe9tition","Pass 4 Nages","Version portable","Version portable : les donn\xe9es sont rang\xe9es \xe0 c\xf4t\xe9 de l'appli, dans {dossier}. Copiez tout le dossier pour emporter l'appli et ses donn\xe9es.","Interclubs","Importer","Interclubs","Composition des \xe9quipes pour les Interclubs toutes cat\xe9gories : \xe9quipes de 10, filles et gar\xe7ons s\xe9par\xe9s, une \xe9preuve individuelle par nageur, 10\xd750 NL, 4\xd7200 NL et 4\xd7100 4 nages. Les points viennent de la table de cotation f\xe9d\xe9rale ; la meilleure \xe9quipe est form\xe9e en premier, puis la suivante avec les nageurs restants.","Records des nageurs","{f} nageuse(s) et {g} nageur(s) ont des records.","Importez le tableau de records du club (Excel), t\xe9l\xe9chargez le mod\xe8le \xe0 remplir, ou saisissez les records dans la fiche de chaque nageur (Nageurs \u203a fiche \u203a Records Interclubs).","Importer des records (Excel)","Mod\xe8le Excel \xe0 remplir","Charger un club d'exemple","24 nageurs fictifs ajout\xe9s, avec leurs records.","Aucun record trouv\xe9 dans ce fichier.","{n} nageur(s) et {r} record(s) trouv\xe9s. Les nageurs d\xe9j\xe0 pr\xe9sents (m\xeame nom) sont compl\xe9t\xe9s, les autres sont ajout\xe9s.","{n} nageur(s) ajout\xe9(s), {m} compl\xe9t\xe9(s).","Composer les \xe9quipes","Aucun nageur n'a encore de record : importez un tableau ou chargez le club d'exemple.","Composition calcul\xe9e le {d}. Touchez une \xe9preuve pour changer de nageur.","Aucune \xe9quipe n'a pu \xeatre form\xe9e.","Nageuses non retenues","Nageurs non retenus","R\xe8gles des Interclubs","Bassin de {b} m \xb7 \xe9quipes de {n}","Bassin de la comp\xe9tition","Les records de ce bassin sont utilis\xe9s en priorit\xe9 ; ceux de l'autre bassin sont convertis (environ 2,5 % d'\xe9cart).","Un nageur peut nager les deux relais 4\xd7","4\xd7200 NL et 4\xd7100 4 nages, en plus de son \xe9preuve individuelle et du 10\xd750 NL.","Estimer les temps manquants","\xc0 partir de l'autre bassin, d'une autre distance de la m\xeame nage, ou de son niveau dans les autres nages (avec 10 % de prudence). Les temps estim\xe9s sont marqu\xe9s ~.","Former une \xe9quipe m\xeame incompl\xe8te","S'il n'y a pas 10 nageurs, l'\xe9quipe est quand m\xeame propos\xe9e, avec les \xe9preuves restantes vides.","Rempla\xe7ants par \xe9quipe","Relais","\xc9preuves individuelles : {liste}.","Filles {n}","Gar\xe7ons {n}","Incompl\xe8te","pts","\xc9preuves individuelles","\xc9preuves individuelles : touchez une ligne pour mettre un autre nageur.","Sous-total individuel","Rempla\xe7ant(s)","Total pr\xe9vu","Qui nage cette \xe9preuve ? Tri\xe9s par points. Un nageur de l'\xe9quipe \xe9change son \xe9preuve ; un rempla\xe7ant prend la place du titulaire.","Nage le {e}","Rempla\xe7ant","Dans l'\xe9quipe {e}","Non retenu","{n} nageur(s) sans aucun record, non pris en compte : {noms}.","\xc9quipe filles incompl\xe8te : il manque {n} nageuse(s).","\xc9quipe gar\xe7ons incompl\xe8te : il manque {n} nageur(s).","{equipe} : certains temps sont estim\xe9s (~), \xe0 v\xe9rifier.","NL","Dos","Brasse","Pap","4 N","10\xd750 NL","4\xd7200 NL","4\xd7100 4 nages","Bassin de {b} m","\xc9quipe incompl\xe8te : il manque {n} nageur(s).","\xc9preuve","Nageur","Temps d'engagement","Points","Points pr\xe9vus d'apr\xe8s la table de cotation f\xe9d\xe9rale FFN, \xe0 partir des records personnels. ~ = temps estim\xe9.","Records Interclubs","{n} record(s)","Records personnels par \xe9preuve et par bassin (format 1:05,32). Ils servent \xe0 composer les \xe9quipes Interclubs.","Tableau de records reconnu : {n} nageur(s) ajout\xe9(s), {m} compl\xe9t\xe9(s). Leurs temps sont dans \xab Records Interclubs \xbb. Composez les \xe9quipes dans la rubrique Interclubs.","OK","Compris","\xe0 l'instant","il y a {n} min","il y a {n} h","il y a {n} j","{n} nageurs","{n} groupes","{n} archives","Ce fichier est ab\xeem\xe9 ou a \xe9t\xe9 modifi\xe9 : son contenu ne correspond plus \xe0 son empreinte de contr\xf4le. Il n'a pas \xe9t\xe9 restaur\xe9, vos donn\xe9es actuelles sont intactes.","Date","Appareil","Version","L'\xe9tat actuel sera d'abord copi\xe9 dans les sauvegardes automatiques : vous pourrez revenir en arri\xe8re.","Restaurer","Vos donn\xe9es, votre s\xe9curit\xe9","Ligne 4 sauvegarde automatiquement, mais aucun logiciel n'est infaillible, pas plus qu'un t\xe9l\xe9phone\u2026 ou qu'une personne. Pensez \xe0 exporter r\xe9guli\xe8rement votre fichier et \xe0 en garder des copies \xe0 deux endroits : une en ligne (Drive, mail\u2026) et une hors ligne (ordinateur, cl\xe9 USB). Une sauvegarde qu'on n'a pas, c'est une saison qu'on ressaisit.","Exporter maintenant","Aucune sauvegarde automatique pour le moment.","Derni\xe8re sauvegarde automatique : {quand}","Aucune copie gard\xe9e hors de cet appareil : pensez \xe0 exporter.","Derni\xe8re copie hors de cet appareil : {quand}","Automatique","Manuelle","Copie de s\xe9curit\xe9 avant {motif}","une restauration","un effacement","une op\xe9ration","Sauvegardes automatiques","Une copie est faite quelques secondes apr\xe8s chaque modification et \xe0 la fermeture, sans jamais \xe9craser la pr\xe9c\xe9dente. Sont gard\xe9es : les 5 derni\xe8res, une par jour sur 7 jours, une par semaine sur 4 semaines, et les copies manuelles et de s\xe9curit\xe9. Ces copies restent sur cet appareil : exportez aussi un fichier de temps en temps.","Sauvegarder maintenant","Copie enregistr\xe9e.","Exporter dans un fichier","Sauvegardes automatiques","Restaurer depuis un fichier","Copie automatique dans un dossier","Sur ordinateur, chaque sauvegarde automatique peut aussi \xeatre \xe9crite dans un ou plusieurs dossiers de votre choix, avec la m\xeame rotation. Choisissez un dossier synchronis\xe9 (Google Drive pour ordinateur, OneDrive, Dropbox) ou une cl\xe9 USB : vous aurez une copie hors de l'ordinateur sans rien faire.","Choisir un dossier","Changer de dossier","Ne plus copier","Copie \xe9crite dans le dossier.","Le dossier n'est pas accessible (cl\xe9 d\xe9branch\xe9e, dossier d\xe9plac\xe9 ?). Les sauvegardes continuent sur cet appareil.","Ce dossier est-il synchronis\xe9 en ligne ou sur un support externe (Google Drive pour ordinateur, OneDrive, Dropbox, cl\xe9 USB) ?\n\nSi oui, les copies y comptent comme copies hors de l'ordinateur. Si c'est un simple dossier de l'ordinateur, le rappel d'export continuera de s'afficher : une panne de l'ordinateur emporterait les deux.","Oui, en ligne ou externe","Non, sur l'ordinateur","Dossier sur l'ordinateur : pensez aussi \xe0 exporter ailleurs.","Ajouter un dossier","En ligne ou externe : compte comme copie hors de l'ordinateur.","Mises \xe0 jour","Rechercher une mise \xe0 jour","V\xe9rifier automatiquement au d\xe9marrage (une fois par jour)","Impossible de v\xe9rifier les mises \xe0 jour : pas de connexion ?","Ligne 4 est \xe0 jour (version {v}).","Ligne 4 {v} est disponible","Version install\xe9e : {v}","Une copie de s\xe9curit\xe9 de vos donn\xe9es est faite avant l'installation.","La page va se recharger avec la nouvelle version. Vos donn\xe9es restent dans ce navigateur.","Ignorer cette version","Plus tard","Mettre \xe0 jour","Recharger","T\xe9l\xe9chargement de la version {v}\u2026","Le fichier t\xe9l\xe9charg\xe9 ne correspond pas \xe0 son empreinte de contr\xf4le : il a \xe9t\xe9 supprim\xe9 et rien n'a \xe9t\xe9 install\xe9. R\xe9essayez plus tard, ou t\xe9l\xe9chargez la version depuis le Labo.","La mise \xe0 jour n'a pas pu se faire. Vos donn\xe9es ne sont pas touch\xe9es. Vous pouvez t\xe9l\xe9charger la nouvelle version depuis le Labo.","Ouvrir le Labo","Installation\u2026 Ligne 4 va se fermer puis se relancer.","une mise \xe0 jour","Nouveaut\xe9s","install\xe9e","Aucune note de version.","Quoi de neuf dans Ligne 4 {v}","Historique complet des versions sur le Labo"],t.w)
B.wL=new A.ao(B.TY,["Cancel","Confirm","Save","Delete","Edit","Apply","Yes","No","Search for a swimmer","Nobody available","est.","(estimated)","actual","Time","Stroke","Name","Type","waiting for times","Unreadable time (e.g. 35.42 or 1:05.32)","Club relay meet","Group {n}","Team {n}","{n} swimmers ({f} F / {g} M)","{n} groups","Build balanced relay teams in seconds.","Language","Device language","You are\u2026","Coach","Manage your swimmers, meet rules, groups and relays.","Swimmer","Keep your profile and times up to date, and track your progress.","You can switch profiles at any time in the settings.","Swimmers","Rules","Events","Proposals","Meet","Archives","Settings","Add a swimmer","Edit swimmer","No swimmers yet. Add your swimmers, or load examples to try the app.","Load 16 example swimmers","Mark everyone present","Delete all swimmers","All swimmers will be deleted. The time history is kept.","Delete {nom}?","{n} swimmers \xb7 {p} present ({f} F / {g} M). Tap a swimmer to edit, tick the box to mark them present.","Age group","Level / cap","Level group, cap colour or team (e.g. \u201cRed cap\u201d, \u201cGreen fish\u201d). Build the club list in Settings \u203a Levels and age groups.","Attending the meet","F","M","?","Girl","Boy","Not specified","Times over {d} m","In seconds (35.42) or minutes (1:05.32). X = does not swim this stroke. Empty = estimated from the other strokes.","Score","best stroke","Duplicate name","Gender not specified","No times","Missing level / cap","Backstroke","Breaststroke","Butterfly","Freestyle","Back","Breast","Fly","Free","Medley","Freestyle","Backstroke","Breaststroke","Butterfly","General rule","Any","2 girls / 2 boys","At least 1 girl and 1 boy","Girls only","Boys only","Presets:","Club gala","Balanced groups, girls and boys spread evenly, everyone swims, 2 relays max per swimmer.","Inter-club","Best team first (team 1, then 2\u2026), best times, thorough search.","Youth event","Balanced groups, at least one girl and one boy per relay, everyone swims, cautious estimate of missing times.","Teams by cap / level","One group per level or cap colour (swimmer profile or training group), everyone swims.","Your current answers will be replaced by this preset.","Preset \u201c{nom}\u201d applied.","Meet","Groups","Relays","Times","Calculation","Meet name","Used for the archives and the time history.","Meet date","What is the goal?","Balance: groups of similar level (club gala, internal meet). Best team first: team 1 gets the fastest swimmers, then team 2\u2026 (official competition).","Balance the groups","Best team first","How many groups? (0 = automatic)","A group = a team that swims each relay once. Automatic: swimmers present \xf7 swimmers in the largest relay.","Do levels / caps matter when forming the groups?","Useful if the club splits its swimmers by level or cap colour (red / white caps, Green fish, competition squad\u2026).","Ignore them","One group per level / cap (e.g. red caps against white caps)","Mix: each level spread evenly across the groups","Balance girls and boys across groups?","Spreads girls and boys equally across the groups.","Balance age groups across groups?","Spreads each age group equally across the groups.","Default relay composition","Applies to events set to \u201cGeneral rule\u201d. Official mixed relay rule: 2 women and 2 men.","Maximum relays per swimmer (0 = no limit)","A swimmer can swim several relays for their group, but only one leg per relay.","Must everyone swim at least one relay?","If yes, a swimmer who already has several relays gives their place to one who has none, losing as little time as possible.","Distance of the entered times","Distance over which swimmers' times are entered. For a relay over another distance (Events tab), the time is converted proportionally: approximate beyond twice this distance (fatigue is not taken into account). For 200 m relays, rather enter times over 100 or 200 m.","Which times should be used?","With history, times swum in archived meets also count.","Entered times only","Entered times + meet history","Which time to keep when there is a history?","Best: the fastest. Latest: the entered time, otherwise the most recent. Average: the 3 most recent meets.","Best time","Latest time","Average of the last 3","If a swimmer has no time for a stroke","The estimate uses their other strokes. Estimated times are shown in italics.","Estimate from their other strokes","Estimate with a safety margin (+5%)","Do not use them for this stroke","Search depth","Thorough tries more group combinations (a little slower).","Quick","Normal","Thorough","Estimation coefficients","Time of each stroke compared with freestyle (1.13 = 13% slower). Starting assumption, to adjust with the club's real times.","Based on French Swimming Federation rules (medley relays, mixed relays) and youth team competitions. Each club adapts these rules.","Turn on the relays of the meet. Tap an event to edit it.","Add an event","Edit event","Restore default events","The event list will be replaced by the 9 default events.","Event name","Number of swimmers","Distance per swimmer","Composition","Weight","Importance in the balancing (2 = counts double).","Exclusivity","Same letter on two relays = all different swimmers.","Medley relay: backstroke, breaststroke, butterfly, then freestyle; each swimmer covers a quarter of the distance.","The event name is empty","Between 1 and 12 swimmers","A medley relay has 4 swimmers","Missing distance","New proposal","Calculating\u2026","No proposals yet. Tap \u201cNew proposal\u201d to calculate the groups and swimming order.","Each new proposal is added to the list. Confirm the one you like: it moves to the Meet tab.","Clear proposals","All proposals will be cleared. The confirmed meet is kept.","Clear all","Proposal","confirmed","Gap between groups","Confirm","Proposal no. {n} confirmed.","Actual times have already been entered for the current meet. Replace it with this proposal?","Swims no relay","No relay despite the rule","Incomplete relay: composition or maximum relays too strict?","No swimmers present.","No valid active event.","The \u201cone group per level / cap\u201d rule is selected, but no swimmer present has a level.","Event \u201c{nom}\u201d skipped: {raison}.","\u201c{nom}\u201d needs {n} different swimmers, but a group only has {k}.","{besoin} legs to swim per group, but with {k} swimmers and {max} relays max each, a group can only cover {cap}.","\u201cEveryone swims\u201d rule impossible: {besoin} legs for groups of up to {k} swimmers.","Could not find groups different from previous proposals: this one repeats groups already proposed.","No meet in progress. Confirm a proposal to start.","See proposals","Enter each swimmer's time. Tap a name to replace the swimmer. Totals and rankings appear as soon as every leg of a relay is timed.","Rankings","Overall ranking","Replace with\u2026","other group","twice in this relay","too many relays","in 2 groups","New meet","The current meet is archived (archives and time history), then you start again.","Times to re-enter","The meet is archived, proposals are cleared and swimmers' times are emptied (names, genders and colours kept).","From the meet's times","The meet is archived and each actual time replaces the swimmer's time (converted to the reference distance; the best one if they swam the same stroke several times). A new proposal is calculated.","Name of the next meet (optional)","Meet archived: {n} times added to the history.","No archived meets yet.","Past meets. The history holds {n} times, used according to the \u201cWhich times should be used?\u201d rule.","Delete this meet from the archives? Times already in the history are kept.","Profile","Appearance","Auto","Light","Dark","Club","Club name","Shown at the top of the screen instead of the app name.","Import a logo","Remove logo","Image too large (1 MB maximum).","Use the club colours","Otherwise: blue and turquoise \u201cpool\u201d theme.","Main colour","Secondary colour","Data","Everything is stored on this device, no account needed.","Swimmers, proposals, meet, archives and history will be deleted. Appearance settings are kept. A safety copy is made just before and stays in Automatic backups.","About","Coming next: poolside stopwatch, training sessions, online groups.","My profile","My times","Complete your profile","My reference times ({d} m)","Share my profile with my coach","Coming soon: by QR code or file, no account needed.","Add a time","Add your competition times to track your progress.","Competition (optional)","Lane 4","Training, swimmer tracking and balanced relays.","Groups","Meet organiser","Meet-only version: swimmers, rules, events, relay proposals and results.","All","No group","Group","Training group","Close","Rename","Share","Print / PDF","Create a group","Group name","e.g. Juniors Tuesday","No groups yet. Create a training group to invite your swimmers by QR code.","{n} swimmer(s)","Delete group \u201c{nom}\u201d? Swimmers are kept, without a group.","Exchange with your swimmers","1. Show a group's invitation QR: the swimmer scans it with the app (Swimmer profile).\n2. The swimmer fills in their profile and times, then shows their \u201cShare my profile\u201d QR.\n3. Scan it here: their profile is added or updated. No account, no internet.","Import a swimmer profile","Invitation QR","Have your swimmers scan this code (Lane 4 app, Swimmer profile, \u201cJoin a group\u201d).","No camera? Copy the code or save it as a file, then send it by message or email.","Copy code","Code copied.","Save as file","Read a Lane 4 code","Scan a QR code","Or paste the code you received","Or open a .ligne4 file","This is not a valid Lane 4 code.","This code is not a swimmer profile.","This code is not a group invitation.","{nom} added: {n} times imported.","{nom}'s profile updated: {n} new times.","No group joined","Join a group","Change group","Leave group","Scan your coach's invitation QR to link your profile to their group.","You are joining \u201c{groupe}\u201d ({club}). Also use the club colours in the app?","Joined group \u201c{groupe}\u201d.","QR code, code to copy or file: your coach imports it in one go.","Show this code to your coach: they scan it in \u201cGroups\u201d > \u201cImport a swimmer profile\u201d.","First enter your name in \u201cEdit\u201d.","Import from Excel","Export to Excel","No sheet with a \u201cName\u201d column was found in this file.","{a} swimmer(s) added, {m} updated.","Layout compatible with the Relay Excel workbook (columns A to I). Times in seconds, X = stroke not swum.","~ = time estimated from the swimmer's other strokes.","General","Language and profile","Appearance and club","Theme, club name, logo, colours","Data and backup","Back up, restore, delete","About and contact","Creator, report a bug, suggest an idea","Theme","Preview","Default colours","Backup","A single .ligne4 file holds everything (swimmers, groups, rules, meets, archives, settings). Keep it safe or move it to another device.","Back up to a file","Backup saved.","Restore a backup","All current data will be replaced by the backup.","Backup restored.","This file is not a valid Lane 4 backup.","Online sync","On Android, Google's system backup can also keep the app data with your account. Coming soon: live groups between coach and swimmers.","Other","Created by {auteur}, with the assistance of Claude (Anthropic).","Report a bug","Suggest an idea","Address copied.","No email app found: the address {mail} has been copied, paste it into your email.","Bug","Suggestion","Describe the problem: what you were doing, what happened, what you expected.","Describe your idea and how it would help you.","Privacy: your data stays on this device. Nothing is sent unless you do it (backup, sharing, QR code). Checking for updates only reads a public file and sends none of your data.","Home","Getting started","Examples","Swimmers ({n})","Add your swimmers one by one, from an Excel file, from a swimmer's QR profile, or load examples to try.","Training groups ({n})","Create a group, tick its swimmers, then show its invitation QR to your swimmers.","See groups","Meet rules","Goal, number of groups, gender balance, relays per swimmer\u2026 or a preset in one click.","Events ({n} active)","Choose the relays swum at the meet.","Calculate the relays","{p} swimmer(s) present. Each calculation adds a proposal; confirm the one you like.","Meet","Enter actual times, print or share the results.","Invite your swimmers in 4 steps","Create a group","For example \u201cJuniors Tuesday\u201d.","Choose its swimmers","Tick swimmers already in the app (added by hand, from Excel or as examples).","Show the invitation QR","Swimmers scan it with the app, Swimmer profile.","Import their profiles","Each swimmer shows their profile QR: scan it to get their times.","Create my first group","No swimmers in this group yet.","Choose swimmers","Add swimmers first (Swimmers or Home tab).","Tick all","Untick all","{n} selected","Currently in \u201c{groupe}\u201d","Quick colours","Colour code: type it in the # field (e.g. 0077B6), or pick on the wheel.","Any distance: 25, 50, 100, 200\u2026 The time is calculated from the distance of the entered times (Rules).","Levels and age groups","Caps, level groups, age groups","Clubs often identify swimmers by a level: a cap colour per group, groups such as \u201cGreen fish\u201d or \u201cDolphins\u201d, colour levels, learn-to-swim badges\u2026 Build your club's list here; each swimmer (or each training group) then gets a level.","Display","Hidden","Dot","Dot + name","Applies to the swimmer list, proposals, the competition and PDFs. Hidden deletes nothing: relay rules can still use it.","Club levels","No level yet. Add one, or start from a template.","{n} swimmer(s)","Add a level","Edit level","Templates","Cap colours","Animal groups (Crabs \u2192 Sharks)","Colour levels (pink \u2192 purple)","French learn-to-swim path (Sauv'nage \u2192 Pass 4 Nages)","Add these levels to your list, or replace the current list? (Swimmers keep their level.)","Add","Replace","Add the levels typed by hand ({n}): {liste}","\u201c{nom}\u201d is used by {n} swimmer(s) or group(s). Also remove it from their profiles?","Keep in profiles","Remove everywhere","Level name","e.g. Red cap, Green fish","Give the level a name.","This name already exists.","Colour","Symbol (optional)","An emoji shown in the dot. Type it or pick one below.","None","None","(not in list)","Leave \u201cNone\u201d to use the training group's level.","Uses the level of group \u201c{groupe}\u201d: {niveau}.","Group level / cap","Given to the group's swimmers who have no level yet.","Level given to {n} swimmer(s).","Give the group level to all its members","Edit group","All levels","No level","Year of birth","Optional: used to work out the age group.","Calculated age group: {c}","FFN age group: {c} (turn on the calculation in Settings \u203a Levels and age groups)","Automatic calculation is on: the year of birth takes priority over this field.","Age groups","Calculated from the year of birth, for the competition year ({annee}). Since 2026 the French federation (FFN) no longer uses Avenirs, Benjamins, Juniors\u2026 but the age reached during the year: U12, U13\u2026 U18.","Typed by hand","The age group is the one typed on each swimmer's profile.","Age (U12, U13\u2026 U18, Seniors)","FFN rule since 2026: age reached during the year.","Former FFN categories","Avenirs, Jeunes, Juniors, Seniors (girls one year earlier than boys), still used by some clubs.","Write the age groups into the profiles","The calculated age group will replace the one typed on each swimmer's profile whose year is known.","{n} profile(s) updated.","Red cap","White cap","Blue cap","Yellow cap","Green cap","Black cap","Crabs","Seahorses","Green fish","Blue fish","Dolphins","Sharks","Pink level","Yellow level","Green level","Blue level","Purple level","Sauv'nage (water safety)","Pass'sports de l'eau (water sports)","Pass'comp\xe9tition (competition)","Pass 4 Nages (4 strokes)","Portable version","Portable version: data is stored next to the app, in {dossier}. Copy the whole folder to take the app and its data with you.","Interclubs","Import","Interclub competitions","Team selection for French \u201cInterclubs\u201d competitions: teams of 10, girls and boys separate, one individual event per swimmer, 10\xd750 free, 4\xd7200 free and 4\xd7100 medley. Points come from the French federation (FFN) scoring table; the best team is formed first, then the next one with the remaining swimmers.","Swimmers' personal bests","{f} girl(s) and {g} boy(s) have personal bests.","Import the club's personal-best spreadsheet (Excel), download the template to fill in, or enter them on each swimmer's profile (Swimmers \u203a profile \u203a Interclub bests).","Import personal bests (Excel)","Excel template","Load a sample club","24 fictional swimmers added, with their personal bests.","No personal bests found in this file.","{n} swimmer(s) and {r} time(s) found. Existing swimmers (same name) are updated, others are added.","{n} swimmer(s) added, {m} updated.","Build the teams","No swimmer has personal bests yet: import a spreadsheet or load the sample club.","Teams built on {d}. Tap an event to change the swimmer.","No team could be formed.","Girls not selected","Boys not selected","Interclub rules","{b} m pool \xb7 teams of {n}","Competition pool","Times from this pool are used first; times from the other pool are converted (about 2.5% difference).","A swimmer may swim both 4\xd7 relays","4\xd7200 free and 4\xd7100 medley, on top of their individual event and the 10\xd750 free.","Estimate missing times","From the other pool, another distance of the same stroke, or their level in other strokes (with a 10% safety margin). Estimated times are marked ~.","Form a team even if incomplete","If there are fewer than 10 swimmers, the team is still proposed with the remaining events empty.","Substitutes per team","Relays","Individual events: {liste}.","Girls {n}","Boys {n}","Incomplete","pts","Individual events","Individual events: tap a line to put another swimmer.","Individual subtotal","Substitute(s)","Expected total","Who swims this event? Sorted by points. A team member swaps events; a substitute takes the swimmer's place.","Swims the {e}","Substitute","In team {e}","Not selected","{n} swimmer(s) without any personal best, not taken into account: {noms}.","Girls' team incomplete: {n} swimmer(s) missing.","Boys' team incomplete: {n} swimmer(s) missing.","{equipe}: some times are estimated (~), please check.","Free","Back","Breast","Fly","IM","10\xd750 free","4\xd7200 free","4\xd7100 medley","{b} m pool","Incomplete team: {n} swimmer(s) missing.","Event","Swimmer","Entry time","Points","Expected points from the FFN scoring table, based on personal bests. ~ = estimated time.","Interclub personal bests","{n} time(s)","Personal bests per event and pool (format 1:05.32). They are used to build Interclub teams.","Personal-best spreadsheet recognised: {n} swimmer(s) added, {m} updated. Their times are under \u201cInterclub personal bests\u201d. Build the teams in the Interclubs section.","OK","Got it","just now","{n} min ago","{n} h ago","{n} days ago","{n} swimmers","{n} groups","{n} archives","This file is damaged or has been modified: its content no longer matches its checksum. It was not restored and your current data is untouched.","Date","Device","Version","Your current data will first be copied to the automatic backups, so you can go back.","Restore","Your data, your safety","Lane 4 backs up automatically, but no software is infallible, and neither is a phone\u2026 or a person. Export your file regularly and keep copies in two places: one online (Drive, email\u2026) and one offline (computer, USB stick). A backup you don't have is a season you type in again.","Export now","No automatic backup yet.","Last automatic backup: {quand}","No copy kept outside this device: remember to export.","Last copy outside this device: {quand}","Automatic","Manual","Safety copy before {motif}","a restore","an erase","an operation","Automatic backups","A copy is made a few seconds after each change and when closing, never overwriting the previous one. Kept: the last 5, one per day for 7 days, one per week for 4 weeks, plus manual and safety copies. These copies stay on this device: export a file from time to time too.","Back up now","Copy saved.","Export to a file","Automatic backups","Restore from a file","Automatic copy to a folder","On a computer, each automatic backup can also be written to one or more folders of your choice, with the same rotation. Pick a synced folder (Google Drive for desktop, OneDrive, Dropbox) or a USB stick: you get a copy outside the computer without doing anything.","Choose a folder","Change folder","Stop copying","Copy written to the folder.","The folder cannot be reached (USB stick unplugged, folder moved?). Backups continue on this device.","Is this folder synced online or on external storage (Google Drive for desktop, OneDrive, Dropbox, USB stick)?\n\nIf so, copies there count as copies outside the computer. If it is just a folder on the computer, the export reminder will keep showing: a computer failure would take both.","Yes, online or external","No, on the computer","Folder on the computer: remember to export elsewhere too.","Add a folder","Online or external: counts as a copy outside the computer.","Updates","Check for updates","Check automatically at startup (once a day)","Could not check for updates: no connection?","Lane 4 is up to date (version {v}).","Lane 4 {v} is available","Installed version: {v}","A safety copy of your data is made before installing.","The page will reload with the new version. Your data stays in this browser.","Skip this version","Later","Update","Reload","Downloading version {v}\u2026","The downloaded file does not match its checksum: it was deleted and nothing was installed. Try again later, or download the version from the Lab.","The update could not be completed. Your data is untouched. You can download the new version from the Lab.","Open the Lab","Installing\u2026 Lane 4 will close and restart.","an update","What's new","installed","No release notes.","What's new in Lane 4 {v}","Full version history on the Lab"],t.w)
